  "_semantic_note": "Base: Forest Green with Light Grey 20% as the page background (decision 2026-11-11); cards, dialogs and logo rows are white. Red, Orange, Blue and Teal fail 4.5:1 as text, so they are fills, icons and borders only; the text beside them uses the *Text token. successText (Grass Green) is 4.65:1 on white but 4.30:1 on the grey page, so it is used only on white surfaces. See docs/brand/contrast_report.md.",
