    "_note": "Arimo (SIL OFL 1.1, Arial-compatible widths) for all app text, decision 2026-11-12: it covers every Hausa, Fulfulde and Kanuri letter (ɓ ɗ ƙ ƴ ŋ ɲ ǝ ʼ), so words never mix fonts. Arial itself cannot be bundled without a licence. The roles (body/heading/mono) are kept so a different heading font can return later. The admin uses its system font stack (Arial on Windows)."
